## Reference

Load the one that matches the job.

- `reference/tools.md` — every tool, grouped by task.
- `reference/structure.md` — one subject per page, placed in the tree.
- `reference/wiki.md` — reading, editing and templating pages.
- `reference/findings.md` — recording hosts, credentials and hashes.
- `reference/tasks.md` — proposing, linking and closing tasks.
- `reference/attachments.md` — reading and adding files on a page.
- `reference/icons.md` — when and how to give a page an icon.
